# In cold code a call of a value is the moves of its operands and one call of a stub, which is what a call of a function is: by itself it stays where it is, however many equal sites there are,
# also where an operation that makes no code stands beside it. With an operation in front of it that a shared body saves, it goes along.
# FORM: Selected
# OPTIONS: check=VerifyEachPass heat=OnlyLoopsAreHot
# RUN: pass OutlineColdOperations
# STATISTIC: OutlinedBodiesCreated = 1
# STATISTIC: ColdSitesOutlined = 24
# CHECK: outcome: Changed

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js"
